                <p>

                    Bird spikes can be considered for
                    suitable ledges, parapets, beams,
                    signboards and other surfaces where
                    birds perch or roost, subject to
                    site conditions and installation
                    requirements.

                </p>

            </details>



            <details>

                <summary>
                    Do you provide customized solutions?
                </summary>

                <p>

                    Yes. You can share details of your
                    application, location and requirement
                    with Ayodel so that an appropriate
                    product or arrangement can be discussed.

                </p>

            </details>



            <details>

                <summary>
                    Can I request a product quotation?
                </summary>

                <p>

                    Yes. Use the enquiry form below to
                    provide the product, quantity and
                    application details.

                </p>

            </details>



            <details>

                <summary>
                    Are bird-control products suitable
                    for commercial buildings?
                </summary>

                <p>

                    Bird-control products may be used in
                    many commercial environments, subject
                    to the specific building, surface,
                    access and installation conditions.

                </p>

            </details>



            <details>

                <summary>
                    How can I contact Ayodel?
                </summary>

                <p>

                    Use the quotation form or the contact
                    details provided on this website.

                </p>

            </details>

        </div>

    </div>

